    "created_at": "2016-06-14T20:07:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-14T20:07:24Z",
    "body": "This is already taken care of by Web IDL. Since the methods take a `CanvasImageSource`, anything that is not a CanvasImageSource automatically throws a TypeError. This is similar to how e.g. `Node.prototype.appendChild` automatically throws a TypeError when you pass it anything that is not a Node. This happens automatically, without the need for extra text, because the method is declared as \n\n```\n  [CEReactions] Node appendChild(Node node);\n```\n\nin https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/.\n",
